Subject: [PATCH net v2] net: iptunnel: fix stale transport header after GRE/TEB decap
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 17:08:15 +0800
Message-ID: <20260419090817.127334-1-jiayuan.chen@linux.dev>
